# export_site_payloads.py, whose contract is the complete series
# (docs/features/site_payloads.md). Disposable: regenerated every run from
# the DB and the manual CSVs. Must stay ignored -- it is what
# data/communes_history.csv committed to WITHOUT this trim, 45+ MB and
# rising with every new source, before the last-10-years default fixed it.
/data/communes_history_full.csv
